    "body": "I created a test case for replaced elements with a similar scenario.\n\n| HTML Element | Chrome | Firefox | Safari |\n|--------------|--------|---------|--------|\n| iframe       | 150px  | 150px   | 400px  |\n| img          | 400px  | 400px   | 400px  |\n| video        | 150px  | 200px   | 400px  |\n| canvas       | 200px  | 200px   | 400px  |\n| embed        | 150px  | 0px     | 400px  |\n| object       | 150px  | 0px     | 400px  |\n",
