    "body": "The variety is… interesting. \n\n* for iframe safari could converge to 150px.\n* for canvas, probably safari should converge to chrome, firefox (but where the 200px comes from?)\n* for img, everyone agrees\n* for video, embed and object, there is no consistent behavior. ⚠️ ",
